.el .ds Aq '
.TH start-tunnel-auth-session-kill 1  "kill "
.SH NAME
start\-tunnel\-auth\-session\-kill \- Terminate auth sessions
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBstart\-tunnel auth session kill\fR [\fB\-\-pubkey\fR] [\fB\-\-token\fR] [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR]
.SH DESCRIPTION
Terminate auth sessions
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-\-pubkey\fR \fI<PUBKEYS>\fR
Enrolled key of a session to terminate
.TP
\fB\-\-token\fR \fI<TOKENS>\fR
ID of a bearer token to revoke
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help
